 "text": "Quip Network is a DePIN protocol providing Post-Quantum Security for blockchains like Bitcoin and Ethereum.\n\n- Goal: Protects crypto assets from being hacked by future quantum computers.\n\n- Tech: Uses QUIPs and WOTS+16 algorithms.\n\n- Token ($QUIP): Used for network fees, staking, https://t.co/E2NCub4j0c", "collected_at": "2026-03-30T15:02:03.535791"}, {"created_at": "2026-03-30T03:18:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2038455891780042976"], "public_metrics": {"retweet_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 229}, "author_id": "64375125", "id": "2038455891780042976", "entities": {"mentions": [{"start": 18, "end": 33, "username": "AarKiBolboBolo", "id": "3355726874"}]}, "conversation_id": "2038455891780042976", "text": "Devlina's account @AarKiBolboBolo was hacked late last night. There were a couple of crypto related tweets which were unlike her on her page, which are gone now but kindly do not interact with the account or DM the account while she is trying to recover it.", "collected_at": "2026-03-30T15:02:03.535795"}, {"created_at": "2026-03-30T02:04:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2038437205287321715"], "public_metrics": {"retweet_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32}, "author_id": "1958071508464758784", "id": "2038437205287321715", "conversation_id": "2038437205287321715", "text": "Things you must do to avoid getting\nHACKED or SCAMMED in crypto\n\n• Don't Participate in all Airdrops\n\n• Be careful of meme coins you buy\n\n• Use a ledger &amp; never connect it to a site\n\n• Don't sign random transactions on site\n\n• Don't click on random links", "collected_at": "2026-03-30T15:02:03.535799"}, {"created_at": "2026-03-30T01:31:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2038428788703256720"], "public_metrics": {"retweet_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "bookmark_count": 0, "impres